{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065030/block/singleImage/3274269/df/01M80YRNRS8V589GJ1AXYEDR4Q.jpg?updatedAt=1795332827\"/><figcaption>男子闖入店內偷東西。(seememeonly07@Threads)</figcaption></figure><p>屯門有夾公仔店遇竊。Threads昨日(21日)流傳一條長約2分鐘的片段，事發於當晚約11時，一名戴口罩男子手持一個背囊和一張矮凳，走進一間夾公仔店。他先取走夾公仔機頂上的一個大袋，再把凳放入袋中。口罩男期間四處張望，其後他再從機頂取走一個電鑽，隨即離開。</p><p>帖主把影片上載至Threads，直言「咁多支cam你都敢偷野」，更要求對方把所偷東西歸還，否則報警。帖主表示：「佢偷我啲貨都無咁嬲，佢偷咗我個電批」。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:43:51.012108+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":238,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T06:28:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T00:57:14.139388+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T07:37:16.258171+00:00","content_hash":"0d09976188c45913b9321695d46801a4d6959b196b4a1db662a37911c8b88885","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T07:43:51.012108+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}